<title>GERMANY: Schering sees small 97 operating margin gain.</title>
<headline>Schering sees small 97 operating margin gain.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German pharmaceutical group Schering AG said it expected only a small gain in its 1997 operating margins.</p>
<p>&quot;The overall operating margin will improve by only a small amount (in 1997),&quot; Schering chief financial officer Klaus Pohle said during a telephone conference with analysts.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
